Subject: [PATCH 14/14] soc: nuvoton: reg: add i3c target registers and soc
 functions

As title.

Signed-off-by: Alvis Sun <yfsun@nuvoton.com>
---
 drivers/i3c/i3c_npcx.c                |  73 ++++
 include/zephyr/drivers/i3c/i3c_npcx.h |  55 +++
 soc/nuvoton/npcx/common/reg/reg_def.h | 536 +++++++++++++++++++-------
